    {
      "bbox": [
        294,
        1080,
        1633,
        1294
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A study conducted by the Personnel Council of the City of New York has disclosed the need for a coordinated City-wide blood credit program to provide for the blood requirements of City employees and their families, as well as to contribute to civic needs and to the requirements of the armed services.",
